If no trigger matches: run the Decision Protocol (Section 0), then show shortcuts:

```
🤖 Cuebert Shortcuts:

ORCHESTRATED PIPELINE (full lifecycle; set language context via Step 0.5):
  /orchestrate [feature] | /o [feature]
  /o --spec | /o --code | /o --review
  /o --preview  (preview phase chain without executing)

DEPLOY HARNESS (separate from /o):
