  /d --preview           (preview deploy pipeline)

GAMING HARNESSES (stubs until M2/M3):
  /play   (play harness — M2; not yet available)
  /ship   (ship harness — M3; not yet available)

DIRECT (single-phase):
  /spec [feature] | /code [slug] | /review [slug] | /sec [slug]

DIAGRAMS-AS-CODE:
  /dac spec | /dac code | /dac review | /dac deploy
  /dac spec|code|review --excalidraw  (alias --e)  →  .excalidraw JSON track

TESTING:
  /test [target] | /test codify [target]

